
### Авторизация
POST https://olimpoks.hydroschool.ru/Auth/Admin
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

login=UGwQiLx3nFLYTdKAhCuX5g==&password=pb2Ov1bKcE3IU7gJuB8cvg==


### Создать парсер
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/parser
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "host": "https://olimpoks.hydroschool.ru",
    "login": "UGwQiLx3nFLYTdKAhCuX5g==",
    "password": "pb2Ov1bKcE3IU7gJuB8cvg=="
}


### Запустить парсинг (создать таску)
POST http://localhost:8081/v1/parser/launch
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "parserId": "561ad27b-296c-411a-9e25-e786f1682d2f",
